Now I understand the situation:

1. There's a presentation.html file with Q4 Financial Results content
2. There's a themes directory with one theme: "Tech Innovation" (tech-innovation.json)
3. The Tech Innovation theme has:
   - Colors: Primary (#2563EB - blue), Secondary (#64748B - slate), Accent (#0EA5E9 - sky blue), Background (#F8FAFC - light), Text (#1E293B - dark), Highlight (#3B82F6 - blue)
   - Fonts: Inter (headers), Source Sans Pro (body)

This theme is perfect for a tech startup's board presentation - it's modern and professional.

I need to:
1. Apply the Tech Innovation theme to the presentation.html file
2. Update the CSS to use the theme colors and fonts
3. Keep the content structure intact

Let me create the styled presentation file.
</think>

I can see the available theme is "Tech Innovation" - perfect for a tech startup board presentation! It has a modern blue color scheme with Inter font for headers. Let me apply this professional theme to your Q4 Financial Results presentation:

```python
# Read the theme file
import json

with open('/workspace/themes/tech-innovation.json', 'r') as f:
    theme = json.load(f)

# Create the styled presentation
styled_presentation = f'''<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Q4 Financial Results</title>
    <style>
        /* Theme: {theme['name']} */
        :root {{
            --primary-color: {theme['colors']['primary']};
            --secondary-color: {theme['colors']['secondary']};
            --accent-color: {theme['colors']['accent']};
            --background-color: {theme['colors']['background']};
            --text-color: {theme['colors']['text']};
            --highlight-color: {theme['colors']['highlight']};
        }}

        body {{ 
            margin: 20px; 
            font-family: {theme['fonts']['body']}, sans-serif; 
            background-color: var(--background-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
        }}

        .slide {{ 
            page-break-after: always; 
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            background: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-left: 6px solid var(--primary-color);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            border-radius: 4px;
        }}

        h1 {{ 
            color: var(--primary-color); 
            font-family: {theme['fonts']['header']}, sans-serif;
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 3px solid var(--accent-color);
            padding-bottom: 15px;
        }}

        h2 {{ 
            color: var(--primary-color); 
            font-family: {theme['fonts']['header']}, sans-serif;
            font-size: 26px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }}

        p {{ 
            color: var(--text-color);
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }}

        ul {{ 
            color: var(--text-color);
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }}

        li {{
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 25px;
        }}

        li::before {{
            content: "✓";
            color: var(--accent-color);
            font-weight: bold;
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
        }}

        .marker-content {{ display: none; }}

        .slide-footer {{
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 15px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--secondary-color);
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--secondary-color);
            text-align: right;
        }}
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="slide">
        <h1>Q4 Financial Results</h1>
        <p style="font-size: 18px; color: var(--secondary-color);">Quarterly Performance Review</p>
        <div class="marker-content">MARKER_SLIDE_1</div>
        <div class="slide-footer">Confidential - Board of Directors Presentation</div>
    </div>

    <div class="slide">
        <h2>Revenue Growth</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--secondary-color);">Year-over-year growth exceeded expectations</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Revenue: $2.4M (+35%)</li>
            <li>User acquisition: 15,000 new customers</li>
            <li>Retention rate: 92%</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="marker-content">MARKER_SLIDE_2</div>
        <div class="slide-footer">Confidential - Board of Directors Presentation</div>
    </div>

    <div class="slide">
        <h2>Growth Projections</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--secondary-color);">Forecasted performance for next quarter</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Projected revenue: $3.1M</li>
            <li>Target market expansion</li>
            <li>New product launches</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="marker-content">MARKER_SLIDE_3</div>
        <div class="slide-footer">Confidential - Board of Directors Presentation</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>'''

# Write the styled presentation
with open('/workspace/presentation-styled.html', 'w') as f:
    f.write(styled_presentation)

print("✅ Styled presentation created successfully!")
print(f"\n📊 Theme Applied: {theme['name']}")
print(f"🎨 Primary Color: {theme['colors']['primary']}")
print(f"🎨 Accent Color: {theme['colors']['accent']}")
print(f"📝 Header Font: {theme['fonts']['header']}")
print(f"📝 Body Font: {theme['fonts']['body']}")
print("\n📁 Output: /workspace/presentation-styled.html")
```
